            </p>
         </li><li class="listitem">
            <p>
               <a href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/goto/SdkForRubyV3/s3-2006-03-01/GetBucketVersioning">AWS SDK for Ruby V3</a>
            </p>
         </li></ul></div>
